  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Bards of the College of Innovation reject the divide between performance and craftsmanship. You don’t forge devices—you imbue them. Each verse can bind an enchantment, each chord a framework for spellwork. Your allies find their blades keener, their armor lighter, and their spells sharper when they bear your creations. In battle, you stand at the center of a web of enhancements, weaving support, control, and precision into a seamless performance. Outside of battle, your craft elevates every expedition, ensuring that your companions are always equipped with exactly what the moment demands.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
